","p",null,{"className":"Hero_date__30zpk","children":["$","$L1a",null,{"delay":0.3,"children":["$","span",null,{"children":"January 28th 2025"}]}]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"Hero_name__eLY42","children":["$","$L1a",null,{"delay":0.3,"children":["$","span",null,{"children":["By ","Emily"]}]}]}]]}]}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"Hero_image__1mu0E","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"fill":true,"delay":0.45,"children":["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/01/creative-web-design-inspo-2025.png 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/01/creative-web-design-inspo-2025-500x281.png 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/01/creative-web-design-inspo-2025-768x432.png 768w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/01/creative-web-design-inspo-2025.png","mediaDetails":{"width":1400,"height":787}},"layout":"fill","lazy":false}]}]}],false]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"ContentBuilder_contentBuilder__jY2p_","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1e"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>1. <a href=\"https://tryboredcow.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bored Cow</a></h2>\n<p>Bored Cow’s cartoon-inspired design has just the right touch of motion. On-scroll animations keep things moving (literally), making the browsing experience feel like you’re part of the action. But the real highlight is that <em>dress up your own cow</em> feature.</p>\n<p>It’s fun, interactive, and super memorable. Bored Cow’s website proves that when your product is as lighthearted as plant-based milk, there’s no harm in adding a little playfulness. It’s a clever, refreshing design that knows exactly how to make an impression – without taking itself too seriously.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: c79c8f80-6a82-4057-b3ad-0203a6cec6e6 --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[false,["$","div",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_video__krg5m","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1f",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/01/Bored-Cow.mp4","layout":"intrinsic"}],null]}]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>2. <a href=\"https://www.ingamana.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ingamana</a></h2>\n<p>Igamana’s website introduces a scroll effect that’s unlike anything we’ve seen before. If you’re tired of the usual scrolling experience and have a lot of visuals to showcase, this could be the solution you didn’t know you needed.</p>\n<p>As you scroll, the image-based case studies gradually expand in a funnel-like motion, creating a distorted, almost warped effect that draws your focus in. It’s an innovative way of guiding the user’s attention, making the visuals feel dynamic and immersive while breaking away from the traditional scroll pattern. Definitely a fresh take on showcasing content.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: f196b3b6-6d16-412e-98b7-21a3cd1946ec --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[false,["$","div",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_video__krg5m","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1f",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/01/ingamana.mp4","layout":"intrinsic"}],null]}]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>3. <a href=\"https://immersive-g.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Immersive Garden</a></h2>\n<p>This one takes interactive design to the next level with a stunning, super slick 3D background that reacts as you move your mouse over it. The effect feels almost alive, adding depth and dimension to the experience.</p>\n<p>Then, as you scroll, the copy appears seamlessly, creating a fluid, engaging journey through the site. It’s a clever mix of subtlety and wow factor, making the entire browsing experience feel like you’re diving deeper into a world rather than just skimming through a page.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: f505a28d-87f4-4b20-adea-12736a964dc5 --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[false,["$","div",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_video__krg5m","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1f",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/01/Immersive-Garden.mp4","layout":"intrinsic"}],null]}]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>4. <a href=\"https://www.clearstreet.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Clearstreet.io&#8217;s</a></h2>\n<p>Clearstreet.io’s homepage hero is a masterclass in displaying software and charts in an engaging, visually appealing way. As you scroll, the screens move seamlessly into place, transforming a standard interface into an interactive storytelling experience.</p>\n<p>This clever use of scrollytelling—where the narrative unfolds as you move through the page—turns what could be dry, data-heavy content into something dynamic and engaging. It’s a brilliant way to bring the complexity of modern brokerage systems to life, guiding users through the platform’s capabilities with style and fluidity.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: 24ca54a7-56b6-4a5a-8832-d2652c1e654d --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[false,["$","div",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_video__krg5m","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1f",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/01/clear-street.mp4","layout":"intrinsic"}],null]}]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>5. <a href=\"https://ctrl.xyz/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ctrl Wallet</a></h2>\n<p>Ctrl.xyz showcases its crypto wallet interface in a way that’s both fun and engaging. The site features a section displaying the app&#8217;s interface, using a bold, vibrant bento-box layout that instantly draws you in.</p>\n<p>As you scroll, on-screen animations and smooth motion design bring the interface to life, creating a dynamic experience that’s both visually satisfying and intuitive. It’s a great example of how to make a complex product, like a crypto wallet, feel interactive and user-friendly, all while keeping things visually appealing.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: 4ea0ea3f-aec9-46bf-ba76-1cb6429c4378 --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[false,["$","div",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_video__krg5m","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1f",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/01/wallet.mp4","layout":"intrinsic"}],null]}]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>6. <a href=\"https://daylightcomputer.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Daylight Computer</a></h2>\n<p>Daylight Computer’s hero video absolutely nails it. It smoothly transitions from day to night, instantly showing how the screen performs in both lighting conditions. It’s a clever, engaging way to highlight the product’s standout feature from the get-go – no need for long explanations, just show and tell. It’s a perfect example of how a simple visual can immediately demonstrate a product’s benefit in a way that feels fresh and interactive.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: 158ea90c-f2ef-4d8d-bd3b-f75c280c4830 --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[false,["$","div",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_video__krg5m","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1f",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/01/Daylight.mp4","layout":"intrinsic"}],null]}]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$20"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[false,["$","div",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_video__krg5m","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1f",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/01/ii-global.mp4","layout":"intrinsic"}],null]}]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>8. <a href=\"https://www.futureform.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Futureform</a></h2>\n<p>Futureform, the Salesforce experts transforming financial services, came to us with a challenge: create a polished, professional site that reflects their growing capabilities, without falling into the corporate vibe typical of their industry.</p>\n<p>The new website had to be sleek, dynamic, and visually engaging—showcasing their offerings, customer stories, blogs, and careers while delivering a cutting-edge user experience. It also needed to be easy for their team to manage as they scaled.</p>\n<p>So, what did we do? We delivered a site that’s bold, sophisticated, and anything but formulaic.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: d87176b5-4f49-4441-b94e-682262e5af06 --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[false,["$","div",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_video__krg5m","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1f",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/01/Futureform.mp4","layout":"intrinsic"}],null]}]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>9. <a href=\"https://www.arcturisdata.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Arcturis</a></h2>\n<p>Arcturis just got a serious upgrade. Their new site is sleek, smart, and designed to match the precision of the real-world-data they use to help improve patient outcomes.</p>\n<p>We kept it clean, minimal, and medical—but with a creative twist. Think interactive dotted backgrounds that nod to their updated logo, using mono type as indicator text to enhance that data feel, and animated illustrations inspired by data infographics.</p>\n<p>With tons more detail on their services and expertise, Arcturis now has a site that’s as sharp as the data they deliver.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: c333b838-c19c-4d9f-84b4-4e592dd9c056 --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[false,["$","div",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_video__krg5m","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1f",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/01/Arcturis.mp4","layout":"intrinsic"}],null]}]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>10. <a href=\"https://www.paffi.it/\">Paffi</a></h2>\n<p>Paffi’s website takes interactive design to a whole new level with its mind-bending 3D scroll effect. As you scroll, blocks twist and shift, adding depth and dimension to the experience. The use of different colours to distinguish between works adds a playful yet organized touch, guiding you through the content with ease.</p>\n<p>The animated background enhances the sense of movement, making the entire site feel dynamic and alive. But the real showstopper? The subtle magic when you hover over the ‘About Us’ button. The lettering twists as your cursor glides over it, adding a delightful interactive element that elevates the whole experience.</p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[false,["$","div",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_video__krg5m","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1f",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/01/ii-global-1.mp4","layout":"intrinsic"}],null]}]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$21"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"$undefined","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"BriefingBanner_banner__YFm51","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"BriefingBanner_bannerImage__u8B8E","children":["$","$L22",null,{"src":"/images/briefing-book.png","width":400,"height":400,"alt":"Briefing Book"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"BriefingBanner_bannerContent__v1VXI","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"BriefingBanner_heading__NPM5A","children":["Start crafting ",["$","em",null,{"children":"better"}]," briefs"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"BriefingBanner_text__BX6wO","children":"Dodge miscommunication headaches, scope creep, expectation misalignment, and brand inconsistency."}],["$","$L14",null,{"href":"/briefing","className":"BriefingBanner_briefingButton__yABiY","children":"Download your free brief te